{"metadata":{"taxon":[{"Plain":"Wiki. "},2],"title":[{"Plain":"“Eilenberg–MacLane 谱”"},1],"slug":[{"Plain":"Eilenberg–MacLane 谱"},0]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>对于 Abel 群 $A$, 其 Eilenberg–Maclane 谱 $HA$ 为表示 $A$-系数上同调的谱.</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"连合谱","text":"连合谱"}},{"Plain":"等同于 [Abel ∞-群](Abel ∞-群.md), 在此对应下 $HA$ 对应 Abel 群 $A$ 自身.</p>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"t-结构","text":"t-结构"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}